// An open type with assignments answers from them; a type that was open and is then closed cannot be reopened; a type closed by default can be opened.
Open Fact x Identified by A, B.
-x(A).
+x(B).
?!x(A).
?x(B).
Open Fact y Identified by A.
Extend Fact y Closed.
Extend Fact y Open.
?!y(A).
Fact z Identified by A.
Extend Fact z Open.
+z(A).
?z(A).
